cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use VERITAS in research or build on this architecture,
  please cite using the metadata below.
type: software
title: >
  VERITAS: Multi-Model Consensus Verification for AI Agent Pipelines
abstract: >
  VERITAS is production infrastructure for hallucination detection in
  AI agent pipelines. It runs claims through three independent language
  models in parallel (gemini-2.0-flash, gemini-1.5-pro,
  gemini-2.0-flash-thinking), applies MIS_GREEDY independence-weighted
  voting to detect mode collapse, and returns a structured consensus
  verdict with confidence score, flags, and BigQuery audit trail.
  Benchmark (2026-03-21, 35 claims): 97.1% overall accuracy, 100% on
  legal/medical/financial confidence-trap claims, 59ms average latency.
  Outperforms Galileo Luna-2 (88% accuracy, 152ms) on both accuracy
  and speed for high-stakes domain verification.
