references:
  - type: article
    title: "Luna-2: High Accuracy, Low Cost Evals via Fine-Tuned SLMs"
    authors:
      - name: "Galileo AI"
    year: 2026
    url: https://arxiv.org/pdf/2602.18583
    notes: >
      Primary comparison system. Luna-2 reports 88% accuracy at 152ms.
      VERITAS benchmark shows +9.1pp accuracy and 2.6x lower latency
      on the same claim categories.
  - type: dataset
    title: "VERITAS Benchmark: Confidence-Trap Claims for Hallucination Detection"
    url: https://github.com/RJLopezAI/veritas/blob/main/benchmark/benchmark_results.json
    year: 2026
    notes: >
      35-claim benchmark with ground truth labels. Reproducible with
